flowchart TB
  subgraph INGEST[Ingestion]
    Sources[Textbooks / Papers / Mark schemes / Examiner reports] --> Extract[Extract]
    Extract --> Dedup[Deduplicate by provenance hash]
    Dedup --> Normalise[Normalise to canonical chunk schema]
    Normalise --> Clean[Clean: NFC, Bangla repair, boundary repair]
    Clean --> Structure[Boundary + metadata + depends_on]
    Structure --> Chunk[Chunk by document type]
    Chunk --> Score[Quality score]
    Score --> Embed[BGE-M3 embeddings]
    Embed --> Lex[Postgres FTS document]
    Lex --> Store[(Neon Postgres + pgvector)]
    Store --> Report[Ingestion report - human review]
    Report --> Publish[Registry: mark corpus published]
  end

  subgraph QUERY[Query time]
    Q[Student query] --> Intent[Intent + curriculum identification]
    Intent --> Reg{Registry: subject available?}
    Reg -- no --> NotCovered[Explicit not-covered response - no retrieval]
    Reg -- yes --> Filter[Metadata filter - SQL WHERE, before ranking]
    Filter --> Lexical[Lexical: Postgres FTS, top 30]
    Filter --> Semantic[Semantic: pgvector + BGE-M3, top 30]
    Lexical --> RRF[Reciprocal Rank Fusion, k=60]
    Semantic --> RRF
    RRF --> Priority[Source priority policy - layer retained as a feature]
    Priority --> Rerank[BGE-Reranker-v2-M3, top 20]
    Rerank --> Gate{Confidence above threshold?}
    Gate -- no --> Refuse[State the limitation - no invented citation]
    Gate -- yes --> Context[Dependency-aware context assembly]
    Context --> Gateway[Model Gateway]
    Gateway --> Gen[Generation]
    Gen --> Validate{Every citation resolves to a retrieved chunk?}
    Validate -- no --> Regen[Reject and regenerate]
    Regen --> Gateway
    Validate -- yes --> Answer[Answer + sources + confidence]
  end

  Store -.-> Filter
  Publish -.-> Reg
